  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T09:55:47.205929Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T10:10:01.932076Z",
  "totalBlocks": 9,
  "translatedBlocks": 9,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "677b76ee4c5d7dc4",
      "translationZh": "我在试用嵌入模型时发现，当你从模型 A 升级到模型 B 时，会面临非常高的回填成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "943ee5c341daf487",
      "translationZh": "也就是说，假设你有模型 A 生成的 1b 个向量，然后你想使用模型 B。这意味着，你必须先用模型 B 为所有文档重新生成嵌入，才能用这个模型提供服务。而在一张 H100 上，这大约需要 108 天（qwen embed 8b，106 篇文档/秒）。不过，我找到了一个更简单的办法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0806dd3b243f08a3",
      "translationZh": "方法非常简单：从源模型构建的旧索引中取出 K 篇文档，再用新模型对它们重新排序。我们发现，当 K 足够大时，检索质量与目标模型相同。（确定 k 才是难点。）我已经在最多 100 万篇文档上测试了 63 次迁移。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81599fe9d86013fe",
      "translationZh": "我得到的最佳结果是从 qwen4b -> 升级到 8b，只取 50 篇文档时，效果就与原生检索相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ca71f02897732ae",
      "translationZh": "这种方法省去了前期昂贵的重新生成嵌入的成本，因为你可以直接从旧索引中获取文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23d528caec4bed80",
      "translationZh": "embedflow 支持 qdrant、pgvector、faiss，并且可以通过 pypi 轻松下载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c47554f74c5a36ab",
      "translationZh": "github 仓库是公开的：https://github.com/arnsri33/embedflow",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b4bc75e553bea97",
      "translationZh": "我希望大家试一试，看看能不能把它用到自己的工作流中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
